@startuml
title FR-03 - View Staff Accounts - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Network Administrator|
start
:Request the staff account list;

|Server — Accounts|
:Check the permitted viewing scope;
:Retrieve account details, roles,\nand organization assignments\nwithin the permitted scope;

if (Retrieval successful?) then ([Yes])

  if (Accounts found?) then ([Yes])
    |Client|
    :Display account details, roles,\nand organization assignments;
    stop

  else ([No])
    |Client|
    :Display an empty staff account list;
    :Display an appropriate no-accounts message;
    stop
  endif

else ([No])
  |Client|
  :Report a loading failure;
  stop
endif

@enduml